":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"bcbefb681664ff6a9f02596abbda39e9b39ab7af4de2cdebffee92a6e7ed87d3","event_uuid":"7061a5f0-2479-4e13-8f5a-a8674b1557bd","position":{"commit_sha":"85c7aba9b613c8f5138b062b7cb88988f3fe0817","position":"1786827711349660001-7061a5f0-2479-4e13-8f5a-a8674b1557bd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786827621345356001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"473d238a-1223-4500-923e-7498ade0fbcf","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"815d-8f56-7237-4b58"},{"link_uuid":"7061a5f0-2479-4e13-8f5a-a8674b1557bd","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"037b-879e-fe13-47d2"}],"description":"## Context\nThe integration census attributes about 32.69 worker-phase seconds to partial-clone fixtures. The current fixture creates a real >100MiB object contrast and is duplicated per xdist worker. Closed cinderlike-weariful-angora deliberately requires proof that filter:blob:none is negotiated and omits a blob that materially distinguishes filtered from full history; that guard cannot be weakened or replaced by config inspection.\n\nA possible split is to retain one exact large-object guard and use a small real Git server/repository for protocol-only cases. Shared mutable servers may create races and cross-worker contamination, and no maintained-OSS consensus has yet been established.\n\n## Plan\n- Map each partial-clone test to protocol negotiation, missing-object, full-clone contrast, named/direct remote, standalone guard, reconvergence, and push behavior.\n- Freeze the one or more tests that require the >100MiB contrast.\n- Prototype isolated small fixtures only for cases whose failure oracle is independent of repository size; do not share mutable state across workers.\n- Seed negotiation, promisor, missing-object, and full-clone defects to prove equivalent detection.\n- Compare fixture setup, call time, macOS wall, and aggregate runner cost; survey maintained Git-heavy OSS suites.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The exact >100MiB filter contrast from cinderlike-weariful-angora remains covered by a real Git fixture.\n- [ ] Every smaller-fixture candidate is proven size-independent by an exact-defect mutation.\n- [ ] No mutable Git server or object database is shared across concurrent workers.\n- [ ] Before/after macOS wall and runner savings are measured.\n- [ ] Prior ticket constraints and at least three maintained OSS projects are recorded.\n- [ ] No production behavior or external Git protocol coverage is replaced by mocks.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/integration/test_ci_tickets_partial_clone.py","reason":"Prototype size-independent real-Git protocol fixtures while retaining the required large-object guard."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","037b-879e-fe13-47d2"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ci","test-runtime","research","git"],"ticket_id":"af11-aad5-bbe7-465a","ticket_type":"task","title":"Experiment with a small protocol fixture beside the required large partial-clone guard","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cd4b778d-0b52-4514-9622-ecfed8dedb5c","bf6ef3fb-8cd7-44d8-bdab-79cc487ab2a4","473d238a-1223-4500-923e-7498ade0fbcf","7061a5f0-2479-4e13-8f5a-a8674b1557bd"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786838726561026090,"uuid":"0c28419f-eaf7-4293-aa64-4e9b8b39b65a"}